Yeah, right.
是啊，没错。

1210
00:50:06.930 --> 00:50:07.050
You know?
你知道吗？

1211
00:50:07.350 --> 00:50:08.650
And there's some deeper truth under...
而且在那背后还隐藏着某种更深层的真相……

1212
00:50:08.650 --> 00:50:15.470
He also has a belief that his love and kind of magnanimous big heart can reconcile all
他还坚信，他的爱以及那种慷慨宽宏的心胸能够调和所有

1213
00:50:15.470 --> 00:50:17.470
awkward, contradictory things.
尴尬、矛盾的事情。

