但我很喜欢她对他说的话。

1216
00:50:20.470 --> 00:50:22.670
You know, we talked about this, it's like you're trying to skip ahead to the end of the
你知道的，我们之前讨论过，这就好比你试图直接跳到书的

1217
00:50:22.670 --> 00:50:22.890
book.
结尾。

1218
00:50:23.010 --> 00:50:24.910
That feels very clear to me that that's what he's doing.
在我看来，这非常明显就是他在做的事。

1219
00:50:25.130 --> 00:50:25.410
Yes.
是的。

1220
00:50:25.430 --> 00:50:28.890
But also she says, that's not the amazing ending you deserve.
但她同时也说，那不是你应得的精彩结局。

1221
00:50:29.170 --> 00:50:30.590
That's not Ted Mosby.
那不是泰德·莫斯比。

1222
00:50:30.770 --> 00:50:31.750
I love that.
我太喜欢这个了。

1223
00:50:31.970 --> 00:50:32.430
I love that.
我太喜欢了。

1224
00:50:32.430 --> 00:50:32.970
I love that moment.
我好喜欢那个时刻。

1225
00:50:33.170 --> 00:50:33.690
It's heartbreaking.
太让人心碎了。

1226
00:50:33.690 --> 00:50:34.570
And she's right.
而且她是正确的。

1227
00:50:35.290 --> 00:50:38.070
She sees him more clearly than he sees himself.
她比他自己更了解他。

1228
00:50:38.450 --> 00:50:39.670
And that says a lot.
这说明了很多问题。

1229
00:50:39.870 --> 00:50:42.030
Like, she loves him still.
比如说，她依然爱着他。

1230
00:50:42.290 --> 00:50:44.710
And whatever that means in that moment, she does love him.
无论那个时刻这意味着什么，她是爱他的。

1231
00:50:44.990 --> 00:50:46.810
She's not saying, leave Stella to be with me.
她并不是在说，离开斯特拉来和我在一起。

1232
00:50:46.890 --> 00:50:50.230
But she's saying, be true to yourself, because I love Ted Mosby.
但她在说，要忠于你自己，因为我爱泰德·莫斯比。

1233
00:50:50.310 --> 00:50:52.070
And this isn't how Ted Mosby's story ends.
而这并不是泰德·莫斯比故事的结局。

1234
00:50:52.470 --> 00:50:52.750
Right.
没错。

1235
00:50:52.750 --> 00:50:58.430
Well, she also, she also is honoring Ted's own mythologizing of his Ted Mosby-ness.
嗯，她也，她也在成全泰德对自身“泰德·莫斯比特质”的神话化。

1236
00:50:58.570 --> 00:50:59.810
Like, he's also in it.
就像，他也身处其中。

1237
00:50:59.910 --> 00:51:01.890
Like, look, we're all invested in this story.
你看，我们都投入到了这个故事中。

1238
00:51:02.470 --> 00:51:02.770
Yeah.
对。

1239
00:51:02.830 --> 00:51:05.350
You know, we want you to get the girl, whether the girl's me or not.
你知道的，我们都希望你能抱得美人归，不管那个女孩是不是我。

1240
00:51:05.570 --> 00:51:08.590
Like, we want you to get the girl because you deserve it.
就像，我们希望你能赢得女孩的芳心，因为你配得上。

1241
00:51:08.630 --> 00:51:10.570
And you are, you would be a great husband.
而且你，你一定会是个好丈夫。

1242
00:51:10.650 --> 00:51:12.270
Like, I think she recognizes all that.
我觉得她意识到了这一切。

1243
00:51:12.630 --> 00:51:12.770
Yeah.
是的。

1244
00:51:12.770 --> 00:51:16.070
I was also, I was at a conference this weekend in Cape Cod that I mentioned to you.
我，我这周末在科德角参加了一个会议，我之前跟你提过。

1245
00:51:16.210 --> 00:51:20.890
